# SAM Template Rules

Follow workspace [infrastructure-rule.md](../../infrastructure-rule.md) for all IaC changes.

## Environments
- Parameter `Environment`: `prod` | `dev` (default `prod`)
- Physical names: `!Sub "stand-${Environment}-..."` (tables, Lambdas, APIs, roles, buckets)
- API stage: literal `prod` on HttpApi (`StageName: prod`) so prod stack keeps `GameApiprodStage`; URLs always end with `/prod` (dev stack uses a different API id, same `/prod` path)
- Secrets: `stand/${Environment}/instagram`, `stand/${Environment}/stripe`
- Cognito JWT: parameters `CognitoUserPoolId`, `CognitoAppClientId`

## Naming conventions (logical IDs unchanged for stack compatibility)
- Stack names: `stand-backend-prod` | `stand-backend-dev`
- Lambda logical IDs: `StandProd<Component>Fn<Action>` (PascalCase)
- Lambda function names: `stand-${Environment}-<component>-fn-<action>` (kebab-case)
- IAM role IDs: `StandProd<Component>Role`

## IAM Roles (existing — reuse, don't create new ones)
- `StandProdGameRole` — game, assign, validate, score, quiz, raffle, infocards-get
- `StandProdBillingRole` — billing, user
- `StandProdWebhookRole` — webhook-instagram, webhook-stripe
- `StandProdSenderRole` — instagram-sender
- `StandProdInfocardsRole` — infocards-process, quiz-generate (needs Bedrock)

## Globals (already set — don't override per-function unless necessary)
```yaml
Globals:
  Function:
    Environment:
      Variables:
        STAGE: !Ref Environment
        GAMES_TABLE: !Ref StandProdGameTable
        # ...
```

## New function template
```yaml
StandProdNewFn:
  Type: AWS::Serverless::Function
  Properties:
    FunctionName: !Sub "stand-${Environment}-<component>-fn-<action>"
    CodeUri: src/stand_prod_<component>_fn_<action>/
    Handler: lambda_function.lambda_handler
    Role: !GetAtt StandProdGameRole.Arn
    Events:
      ApiEvent:
        Type: HttpApi
        Properties:
          ApiId: !Ref GameApi
          Path: /v1/<route>
          Method: <METHOD>
```

## Deploy commands
- `sam build` — builds all functions
- `sam deploy --config-env prod` — production stack
- `sam deploy --config-env dev` — dev stack (see docs/DEV_ENVIRONMENT.md)
- `sam local invoke StandProd<Fn> -e events/test.json` — local test
